# Flamecache Gecko: "When this creature enters, if an opponent lost life this turn, add {B}{R}." Bot1 bolts Bot2 first
# (20 -> 17), then casts the Gecko with the rest of the Black Lotus's red. The enters trigger is not a mana ability (the
# ruling): after the Gecko resolves it sits on the stack (Stack.Count = 1, pool still empty) and can be responded to.
# Resolving it fills the pool with {B}{R}, and the {R} is the only mana that can pay a second Bolt (17 -> 14); the {B} stays.

